  },
  "question": {
    "text": "If an angle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;of a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> satisfies <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the roots of the quadratic equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>27</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sec</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cot</mi><mi>A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sec</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sec</mi><mi>A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Clearly,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, roots of equation</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>27</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>729</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>720</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>18</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>18</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>sec</mi><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>A</mi></math>.</p><p>Hence, the roots are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sec</mi><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>A</mi></math>.</p>"
  }
}